      "source": "Derives from the <a href=\"CacheAspectSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>CacheAspectSupport</code></a> class which\ncontains the integration with Spring's underlying caching API.\nCacheInterceptor simply calls the relevant superclass methods\nin the correct order.",
      "translation": "继承自包含与 Spring 底层缓存 API 集成的 <a href=\"CacheAspectSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>CacheAspectSupport</code></a> 类。CacheInterceptor 只需按正确顺序调用相关的父类方法即可。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "CacheInterceptors are thread-safe.",
      "translation": "CacheInterceptors 是线程安全的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
